    "kidsy_static_customer_testimonial_7q3raX": {
      "type": "Kidsy-static-customer-testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_wJ8NnB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Kidsy had exactly the baby/pet gates we…",
            "text": "<p>Kidsy had exactly the baby/pet gates we needed...good price...good shipping...good items. If you have children or know someone who has children...this site is a keeper! They get 10 stars!!</p>",
            "author": "Eileen W",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_gewprH": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Quick response",
            "text": "<p>Ordered a gate prior to this one, UPS lost it on route. I reached out to Kidsy via email and they secured a refund from UPS. Was hesitant to order again, but I couldn't find the gate at a more reasonable price. 2nd order arrived with no issues. Gate is sturdy and the dog (Husky) hasn't gotten through it (he's an escape artist). Quick delivery from start to finish.</p>",
            "author": "Shelli F.",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_9NH4qJ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Great, trustworthy experience",
            "text": "<p>Great deals, easy checkout with lots of payment options, shipped very quickly, and everything was packed well and looked exactly as it was described! I didn't end up needing any intervention with my shipping experience but appreciate the option to cover lost packages for a minimal fee, especially as we get into the late and lost package holiday season. I'll definitely be getting more of my baby gear from Kidsy.</p>",
            "author": "Lydia M",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_qc9MbE": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "The best prices going and shipping is…",
            "text": "<p>The best prices going and shipping is fast.</p>",
            "author": "Tanya and Gina Hill",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_CYMLeN": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Great price and fast delivery.",
            "text": "<p>Great price and fast delivery.</p>",
            "author": "Alan Brown",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_P6wEnL": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "I appreciated the detailed description",
            "text": "<p>I appreciated the detailed description, I knew I was getting a floor model and it came in perfect shape at a much reduced cost. When I thought the cupholders weren't included, I reached out to them and then we found them and they were very responsive and thankful that I let them know. Everything is fine.</p>",
            "author": "Carol",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Qx66bd": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Bouncer worked fine",
            "text": "<p>Bouncer worked fine. Was a little worried when it showed up but it was perfectly fine!</p>",
            "author": "SE",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_fFcgnz": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Quick delivery and items in great…",
            "text": "<p>Quick delivery and items in great condition!</p>",
            "author": "Heather Clarke",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UgBnHG": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "less money less hassle",
            "text": "<p>Found an item still in its original packaging for 2/3 of the original pricing.</p>",
            "author": "viki",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_bzCtUj": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Good prices and fast shipping",
            "text": "<p>Good prices and fast shipping</p>",
            "author": "Jay Kristov",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_bezE3X": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "My item shipped very quickly and I…",
            "text": "<p>My item shipped very quickly and I received it about 3 days after I ordered it! It came in an extra protected box as well! Very pleased with my purchase!</p>",
            "author": "Amanda Almanza",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_NpCPhx": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Was pleased with the car seat I bought…",
            "text": "<p>Was pleased with the car seat I bought from Kidsy. It was in the condition they described and arrived quickly. Thank you!</p>",
            "author": "Melissa Weaver",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_zjRRGc": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "The products were very good",
            "text": "<p>The products were very good. More than I’d expected them to be. The color of the diaper bag is beautiful and I know my daughter in love will be happy with it.</p>",
            "author": "SUSAN PASSMORE",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_hyy6rB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Kidsy Customer Service Review",
            "text": "<p>Kidsy had a great selection of deeply discounted baby gates. Unfortunately, there was a piece missing when I received my package. I didn't realize it until after the 14 day return/exchange window. But I reached out, and they were willing to send me the piece anyway at no extra charge. I really appreciated the customer service.</p>",
            "author": "Josh Radcliff",
            "verify_buyer": true
          }
        },
        "testimonial_XLWgb3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "review_star": 5,
            "review_title": "Great product",
            "text": "<p>I was impressed with the shipping and the item I got looked brand new. Great product and I’ll be ordering again.</p>",
